; Fixed-literal choice variants keep their spellable legacy names and use the exact canonical
; fallback only when that legacy spelling is unspellable. This corpus fixture is deliberately the
; compile-breadth witness: it carries mixed, c-style, anonymous, and bare-group consumers through
; native, wasm, JSON, preserve, and component corpus profiles.
